&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2022年９月　当社取締役（監査等委員）就任（現任）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E39377-000FujisawaMasatakaMember">（注４）</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E39377-000YokoiYukieMember">

取締役


（監査等委員）

</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E39377-000YokoiYukieMember">横井 ゆきえ</jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E39377-000YokoiYukieMember">1980-02-24</jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E39377-000YokoiYukieMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2002年４月　㈱ジェンヌ入社（現㈱ＡＢＣ Ｃｏｏｋｉｎｇ Ｓｔｕｄｉｏ）&lt;/span&gt;
